  "body": "From https://github.com/w3c/pointerevents/pull/381 \r\n\r\n[Pointer Events](https://www.w3.org/TR/pointerevents/upcoming/) link to 3 places in HTML that are not exported:\r\n\r\n* html/#task-queue (from [The pointerrawupdate event](https://www.w3.org/TR/pointerevents/upcoming/#the-pointerrawupdate-event))\r\n* html/#initiate-the-drag-and-drop-operation (from [drag operation starts](https://www.w3.org/TR/pointerevents/upcoming/#the-pointercancel-event))\r\n* html/#event-loop-processing-model | animation frame callbacks: not sure if we need a hook for [step 12](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#event-loop-processing-model) (from [ animation frame callbacks](https://www.w3.org/TR/pointerevents/upcoming/#the-pointermove-event))\r\n\r\ncc @patrickhlauke\r\n",
